    "html": "<p>The distance between the centre of planet A and the centre of planet B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. The mass of planet A and B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16m\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25m\"></span> respectively. The resultant gravitational force on an object placed at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from the centre of planet B is zero. What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{d}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{9}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{9}\"></span>  </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{16}{25}\"></span>  </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{5}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
